  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5703.09 Release of a Person’s Criminal History Record Information",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-11-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5703.09 Release of a Person’s Criminal History Record Information.\n\n(a) A person who requests his or her CHRI shall receive a copy of his or her own criminal conviction records after complying with Saf-C 5703.08 and paying $25.00 for the record check.\n\n(b) Notwithstanding (a) above, a person shall receive a copy of his or her own criminal conviction and arrest records after complying with Saf-C 5703.08, paying $25.00 for the record check, and indicating specifically on the authorization form that the person wants his or her criminal arrest records.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5700) #6704, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8173, eff 9-21-04; ss by #9329, eff 11-21-08, EXPIRED: 11-21-16\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
